 public partial static AppleDto ToApple(Apple apple);
 ```
 
+Multiple mapping configurations can be included by applying the attribute multiple times.
+This is useful to reuse configurations of mappings between interfaces or base types implemented by the mapped types.
+Each configuration is included at most once, even if it is reachable via multiple included configurations:
+
+```csharp
+[MapProperty(nameof(IAudit.CreatedBy), nameof(IAuditDto.Creator))]
+public static partial void MapAudit(IAudit source, IAuditDto target);
+
+[MapProperty(nameof(IOwnable.Owner), nameof(IOwnableDto.OwnerName))]
+public static partial void MapOwnable(IOwnable source, IOwnableDto target);
+
+// highlight-start
+[IncludeMappingConfiguration(nameof(MapAudit))]
+[IncludeMappingConfiguration(nameof(MapOwnable))]
+// highlight-end
+public static partial HouseDto ToDto(House house);
+```
+
 The following configurations will be included:
 
 - `MapProperty`
